note hub/src/35-art.om: the hub's one picture, drawn by arithmetic.
note
note Four planes seen from above at an angle (hardware at the bottom, then software, models, agents)
note and one plumb line dropped through their centres, with its bob below the lowest plane. Every
note coordinate is computed here: plane p has its centre at (250, 520 - 120 p), half-width 210 and
note half-height 60, and carries a 6 by 6 grid. The project count beside each plane is read from
note STACK.tsv, and each lit tile on a plane is one of those projects: project k of plane p sits in
note grid cell (11k + 1 + 7p) mod 36. Sixteen loose fragments drift around the planes; their places come
note from a fixed linear congruential sequence, so the picture is the same on every build. No image
note file is shipped.

text a01 "<svg class='art' viewBox='0 0 620 640' role='img' aria-labelledby='artt'><title id='artt'>Four planes, hardware, software, models and agents, with one plumb line through all of them. Each lit tile is one project on that plane. Loose fragments drift around them.</title>\n"
text a02 "<polygon class='pl' points='"
text a03 "'/>\n<path class='gr' d='"
text a04 "'/>\n"
text a05 "<path class='ln' d='M250 36V588'/>\n<circle class='cap' cx='250' cy='36' r='4'/>\n<polygon class='bob' points='250,584 260,597 250,618 240,597'/>\n"
text a06 "<circle class='halo' cx='250' cy='"
text a07 "' r='7' style='animation-delay:"
text a08 "ms'/><circle class='nd' cx='250' cy='"
text a09 "' r='6' style='animation-delay:"
text a10 "ms'/>\n"
text a11 "<text class='lb' x='474' y='"
text a12 "'>"
text a13 "</text><text class='ls' x='474' y='"
text a14 " project"
text a16 "</text>\n"
text a15 "</svg>\n"
text a17 "<polygon class='tl' points='"
text a18 "' style='animation-delay:"
text a19 "<rect class='jk' x='"
text a20 "' y='"
text a21 "' width='"
text a22 "' height='"
text a23 "' style='animation-delay:-"
text ap0 "HARDWARE"
text ap1 "SOFTWARE"
text ap2 "MODELS"
text ap3 "AGENTS"

note plsub: the subsystem (index into the ledger groups) that is number k (0 or 1) of plane p, or 9.
note Plane 0 hardware: gpu, os. 1 software: compiler, runtime. 2 models: train. 3 agents: agents,
note protocol. 4 is the line itself: evidence, docs.
fn plsub p ulong k ulong to ulong
if eq p 0
if eq k 0
ret 1
end
ret 2
end
if eq p 1
if eq k 0
ret 0
end
ret 3
end
if eq p 2
if eq k 0
ret 4
end
ret 9
end
if eq p 3
if eq k 0
ret 6
end
ret 5
end
if eq k 0
ret 7
end
ret 8
end

note plcount: projects on plane p
fn plcount p ulong to ulong
n = get agc plsub p 0
s = plsub p 1
if lt s 9
n = add n get agc s
end
ret n
end

note plom, plfo: lines of Omega and of other languages on plane p
fn plom p ulong to ulong
n = get ago plsub p 0
s = plsub p 1
if lt s 9
n = add n get ago s
end
ret n
end
fn plfo p ulong to ulong
n = get agf plsub p 0
s = plsub p 1
if lt s 9
n = add n get agf s
end
ret n
end

note artpt: "x,y"
fn artpt x ulong y ulong to void
emu x
emb 44
emu y
end

note artseg: "Mx1 y1Lx2 y2"
fn artseg x1 ulong y1 ulong x2 ulong y2 ulong to void
emb 77
emu x1
emb 32
emu y1
emb 76
emu x2
emb 32
emu y2
end

note artplane: the rhombus of plane p and its grid
fn artplane p ulong to void
cy = sub 520 mul 120 p
em a02
artpt 250 sub cy 60
emb 32
artpt 460 cy
emb 32
artpt 250 add cy 60
emb 32
artpt 40 cy
em a03
for i ulong 5
t = add i 1
u = mul 35 t
v = mul 10 t
y1 = add sub cy 60 v
y2 = add cy v
artseg add 250 u y1 add 40 u y2
artseg sub 250 u y1 sub 460 u y2
end
em a04
end

note arttile: the lit tile of project k on plane p, in grid cell (11k + 1 + 7p) mod 36. Cell (i, j) has
note its centre at (250 + 35 (i - j), cy - 60 + 10 (i + j + 1)).
fn arttile p ulong k ulong to void
cy = sub 520 mul 120 p
c = rem add add mul k 11 1 mul p 7 36
i = div c 6
j = rem c 6
x = sub add 250 mul 35 i mul 35 j
y = add sub cy 60 mul 10 add add i j 1
em a17
artpt x sub y 7
emb 32
artpt add x 24 y
emb 32
artpt x add y 7
emb 32
artpt sub x 24 y
em a18
emu add 2200 mul 70 k
em a10
end

note arttiles: one tile per project of plane p (at most 36)
fn arttiles p ulong to void
n = plcount p
if gt n 36
n = 36
end
for k ulong n bound 36
arttile p k
end
end

note artjunk: sixteen loose fragments. s runs through s' = (1103515245 s + 12345) mod 2^31 from 2026.
fn artjunk to void
s = ulong 2026
for i ulong 16
s = and add mul s 1103515245 12345 2147483647
x = add 16 rem shr s 8 440
y = add 24 rem shr s 4 590
w = add 5 rem shr s 16 7
if and ge x 226 le x 274
x = add x 60
end
em a19
emu x
em a20
emu y
em a21
emu w
em a22
emu w
em a23
emu rem shr s 3 9000
em a10
end
end

note artnode: the lit node where the line crosses plane p. Its light-up is delayed to the moment
note the falling line reaches it: 250 ms + 1900 ms * (cy - 36) / 552.
fn artnode p ulong to void
cy = sub 520 mul 120 p
d = add 250 div mul 1900 sub cy 36 552
em a06
emu cy
em a07
emu d
em a08
emu cy
em a09
emu d
em a10
end

note artlabel: the name of plane p and its project count, right of the plane
fn artlabel p ulong to void
cy = sub 520 mul 120 p
em a11
emu add cy 4
em a12
if eq p 0
em ap0
end
if eq p 1
em ap1
end
if eq p 2
em ap2
end
if eq p 3
em ap3
end
em a13
emu add cy 21
em a12
n = plcount p
emu n
em a14
if ne n 1
emb 115
end
em a16
end

note art: the whole picture
fn art to void
em a01
artjunk
for p ulong 4
artplane p
arttiles p
end
em a05
for q ulong 4
artnode q
artlabel q
end
em a15
end
